
---

## 2️⃣ `.gitignore` (copy-paste fully)

```gitignore
# =========================
# Node / React
# =========================
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.env

# Build output
frontend/build/

# =========================
# Java / Spring Boot
# =========================
target/
*.log
*.class

# Maven wrapper
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# IDE files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# =========================
# Docker
# =========================
*.tar

# =========================
# H2 Database files
# =========================
*.mv.db
*.trace.db
